        "@id": "https://ubuntu.com/security/notices/USN-8580-1",
        "name": "USN-8580-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that the Ubuntu-specific SetLanguage patch to AccountsService incorrectly handled dropping privileges. A local attacker could use this issue to execute arbitrary commands as an administrator. (CVE-2026-61897)  It was discovered that the Ubuntu-specific SetLanguage helpers for AccountsService incorrectly handled parsing configuration files. A local attacker could use this issue to execute arbitrary commands. (CVE-2026-61898)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2026-61897",
          "CVE-2026-61898"
        ]
      },
